# 统一行尾：Windows 队友写出来的 CRLF 不能把 Linux/评审环境的 diff 炸成满屏
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确按二进制处理，避免被当文本转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.onnx binary
*.pt binary

# 这些文件不需要参与语言统计与合并
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
